      "text": "1. INSTALL 3-4 SHIFT VALVE"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Install the 3-4 shift valve and spring.",
        "(b) Install the plug into the bore. Coat the retainer with petroleum jelly and install it."
